# FF4: the title's LOAD GAME. Write a slot first, then load it from the title:
#   OpenFF.exe --game=ff4 --map=t01_00 --save-dir=<dir> --drive=Docs/Drives/ff4-save.drive
#   OpenFF.exe --game=ff4 --save-dir=<dir> --drive=Docs/Drives/ff4-title-load.drive --log=general,file --screenshot-dir=shots --screenshot-every=1
# The title shows LOAD GAME between NEW GAME and QUIT GAME; Down, Z opens the three files (File 1 written),
# Z loads it: "ff4 title: load, to t01_00", the jump, "load: landed on t01_00", no "Exception".
wait 14
press Down
wait 1
press Z
wait 2
press Z
until jump: ff4 60
wait 6
say ff4 title load done
quit
